  "description": "Muzzle: a cozy, pastel design system for WPF. Light and Dark themes with Coral, Lavender, Mint, Peach or custom accents switchable at runtime, soft elevation shadows, and tactile jelly physics on every control. Includes 40+ restyled and custom controls (MuzzleWindow, PropertyGrid, DataGrid, CommandPalette, Growl, Dialog, Drawer, NavigationView, pickers, Avatar, Carousel…), attached behaviors (JellyBehavior, ClipHelper, ScrollViewerAssist, FocusTrap, WindowStateSaver, Mica/Acrylic backdrops), converters and a 156-icon vector pack.",
